{"version": 1, "slug": "tistory-21", "visibility": "public", "title": "[DreamHack] - abcdefg-who", "content": "<div class=\"tistory-content\">\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/2202ea300758cb1997008fcac788cc6ad1e9ae2ffad8e7f15fc322724719a59c.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>드림핵 abcdefg-who 문제</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/e70da9ba23f5815e2772da0aff27a0ad0bd727ef4e195a0861dd3c890ad891f3.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/b6c843d1a5a5560d15ab97a9265e6b74054632899692f98a14490952fab75bc9.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>다운로드받은 파일에서 ssh 접속하는 방법을 알려주는 txt 열어봄</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/bdc432cf3425f0d152f6c932642bc321def784e5d2eb40a099250db20b519fa8.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>드림핵에서 vm 서버를 연 후 CMD를 사용해서 접속</p>\n<p> </p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>find / -mtime -7 -type f 2&gt;dev/null | grep -v /proc | gerp -v \\sys</code></pre>\n<p> </p>\n<p>-&gt; 최근 7일 내 수정된 파일 탐색</p>\n<p>/home/frank/.secret_log 라는 수상한 파일 발견</p>\n<p> </p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>cat /etc/passwd</code></pre>\n<p> </p>\n<p>-&gt; 일반 계정들으 로그인 셀이 모두 /home/frank/.bash.sh 로 변경된 것을 확인</p>\n<p> </p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>sudo cat /home/frank/.secret_log</code></pre>\n<p> </p>\n<p>-&gt; dream 계정은 sudo 권한을 보유하고 있어서 sudo로 .secret_log 읽기 가능</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/33add7afe00fc3fa37611cf4e9d6a49835aa99ecac412762230b503a7a055ed8.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>flag 발견</p>\n</div>", "assets": ["2202ea300758cb1997008fcac788cc6ad1e9ae2ffad8e7f15fc322724719a59c.png", "33add7afe00fc3fa37611cf4e9d6a49835aa99ecac412762230b503a7a055ed8.png", "b6c843d1a5a5560d15ab97a9265e6b74054632899692f98a14490952fab75bc9.png", "bdc432cf3425f0d152f6c932642bc321def784e5d2eb40a099250db20b519fa8.png", "e70da9ba23f5815e2772da0aff27a0ad0bd727ef4e195a0861dd3c890ad891f3.png"]}